{"unit_id":"2074851180qw-code__dsh-fish-mood#feature-1","repo":"2074851180qw-code/dsh-fish-mood","commit":"de26090aad857da449f6d2d9c8546cc638a62129","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-fish-mood 的功能「状态结算」：按距上次更新时间结算七个状态，并据此计算聊天权重、字数预算和语气。MCP 工具读取状态时触发结算，结果包含当前数值和建议。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/server.cjs:95-167","lib/server.cjs:169-180"]}
{"unit_id":"2074851180qw-code__dsh-fish-mood#feature-2","repo":"2074851180qw-code/dsh-fish-mood","commit":"de26090aad857da449f6d2d9c8546cc638a62129","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-fish-mood 的功能「记录互动事件」：通过 fish_event 记录原因，可选择预设事件或输入各维度增量。事件会更新状态、保存前后变化，并保留最近 200 条流水。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/server.cjs:19-26","lib/server.cjs:210-239"]}
{"unit_id":"2074851180qw-code__dsh-fish-mood#feature-3","repo":"2074851180qw-code/dsh-fish-mood","commit":"de26090aad857da449f6d2d9c8546cc638a62129","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-fish-mood 的功能「本地状态面板」：浏览器打开本机面板可查看七维状态、聊天权重、字数预算和语气，也可在管理员模式开启后调整数值。面板通过本地 HTTP 接口读写状态。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/server.cjs:250-370"]}
